      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 835212174,
      "version": 429,
      "versionNonce": 1294284690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785167016454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Spring core is the most important module opf spring framework.\n\n2. Its good understanding is very essential before we study any other\nspring module.\n\n3. Spring core contains many features such as\n\n  -> DI\n  -> IOC\n  -> BeanLifeCycle\n  -> Autowiring\n  -> Beanscope",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Spring core is the most important module opf spring framework.\n\n2. Its good understanding is very essential before we study any other spring module.\n\n3. Spring core contains many features such as\n\n  -> DI\n  -> IOC\n  -> BeanLifeCycle\n  -> Autowiring\n  -> Beanscope",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
