      "versionNonce": 1613336334,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785167248045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Types of class java project contains, as per industry standard \njava as 3 types of classes\n\n1. POJO\n2. Bean\n3. Component\n\n\n                            POJO\n                            =====",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Types of class java project contains, as per industry standard \njava as 3 types of classes\n\n1. POJO\n2. Bean\n3. Component\n\n\n                            POJO\n                            =====",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rrgtsv-s9N0uGJiUZemBg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 348,
      "y": 1343,
      "width": 818,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
