      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785169021975,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Any class containg business logic is called component class.\n\n\n                     Dependency\n                     ===========\n\n1. class require another class serevices for implementing some task\nthen we say it depend on that class. \n\n2. Class which require another class is called target, and class which \nprovide something is called dependent. \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Any class containg business logic is called component class.\n\n\n                     Dependency\n                     ===========\n\n1. class require another class serevices for implementing some task\nthen we say it depend on that class. \n\n2. Class which require another class is called target, and class which \nprovide something is called dependent. \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
